WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,990 --> 00:00:04,990
Can this light generate electricity?

2
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:08,310
If it can really generate electricity, it will always be on.

3
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:09,710
Isn't that just a Yongdong recharge?

4
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:11,310
Go back and find a solar version to try

5
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:13,070
Let me give you a nickname first

6
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:17,030
When I hear your voice, call me one by one.

7
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:18,900
I'll tell you the name later when you grow up.

8
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:25,840
Physical strength and energy are constantly being replenished

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,540
Now I can be considered half a brave motor.

10
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:35,960
I can't run anymore

11
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:39,560
Su Hao, something happened.

12
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,860
Song Zihao and Chen Zhiyu just announced downstairs

13
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,580
Practical cooperation should be implemented for everyone

14
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:46,300
Divide people into two departments: logistics and combat

15
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:50,290
The combat department has to go out and kill every day.

16
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,530
Only then can you get double portions of food

17
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:53,130
Logistics can only receive half of it
